  "paper": "paper_1a",
  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The diagram shows wavefronts of light incident on an air–glass boundary.</p>\n<p>The angle between the incident wavefront and the normal, N, is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta\"></span>.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>Which of the following gives the correct expression for the refractive index of the glass, where <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r\"></span> is the angle of refraction?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{sin \\theta}{\\textit{sin r}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{sin 90-\\theta}{\\textit{sin r}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textit{sin r}}{sin \\theta}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textit{sin r}}{sin 90-\\theta}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
